static/lib/doomgeneric/doomgeneric.js, doomgeneric.wasm
    Built by tools/build_engine.sh from doomgeneric
    (https://github.com/ozkl/doomgeneric), commit
    dcb7a8dbc7a16ce3dda29382ac9aae9d77d21284, which derives from Chocolate
    Doom and the id Software Doom source release.
    License: GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any
    later version, as stated in the compiled source files. See
    doomgeneric/COPYING.
    doomgeneric's own doomgeneric.c and dummy.c, which state no "or later",
    are not compiled; tools/engine/doomgeneric_odoo.c (GPL-2.0-or-later)
    replaces them. A few doomgeneric headers without a notice are included
    for their declarations only.
    Our changes: tools/engine/doomgeneric_odoo.c, tools/engine/odoo_hooks.h
    and tools/engine/odoo_hooks.patch. Corresponding source: tools/ plus the
    upstream commit above.

